[
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "Chapter 3. Numerical differentiation",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.15043,
   0.08604,
   0.40368,
   0.0995
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Header; furniture: kecualikan atau nilai terpisah"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "35",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.84471,
   0.08638,
   0.86316,
   0.09639
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Header; furniture: kecualikan atau nilai terpisah"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "Note that the exact error equals",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.12389,
   0.38406,
   0.13733
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "M-Q(h)=e-2.7525\\ldots=-0.0342\\ldots\\ldots",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.35346,
   0.14893,
   0.6605,
   0.16282
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "In this example the error estimate is very reliable.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.17568,
   0.51771,
   0.18912
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "To receive a better approximation the error estimate can be added to the approximation:",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.19754,
   0.80244,
   0.21099
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "Q(h)+c_ph^p=2.7525\\ldots-0.0348\\ldots=2.7177\\ldots.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.32235,
   0.22147,
   0.69152,
   0.23817
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "In the above example, the value of p was computed using Richardson's extrapolation. However,\nusing Theorem 3.2.1, it is clear that p = 1, and this value could have been used immediately in\nequation (3.13b) in order to determine cphp. In practice, more complex situations are found, and\nthe following complications may occur:",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.25595,
   0.86361,
   0.31335
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "- Itis not known whether higher-order derivatives exist and/or are bounded.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.17795,
   0.32462,
   0.75471,
   0.33919
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=List"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "- The final resultis a combination of various approximation methods. The influence of these\napproximations on p is not always clear.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.17795,
   0.34892,
   0.86316,
   0.37763
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=List"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "- During implementation of the algorithm in a computer program, errors may be made.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.17795,
   0.38652,
   0.82977,
   0.40109
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=List"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "To reveal any of these complications it is good practice to verify whether the calculated p is close\nto the p that follows from theory.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.41171,
   0.86361,
   0.44135
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "3.7.3 Formulae of higher accuracy from Richardson's extrapolation *",
  "text_level": 1,
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.15043,
   0.45999,
   0.78501,
   0.4766
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Heading1; DP-Bench hanya punya 1 level heading; level asli belum diverifikasi"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "In several applications the value of p in (3.10) is known. In that case Richardson's extrapolation\ncan be used to determine formulae of higher accuracy.",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.48366,
   0.86361,
   0.51329
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "This is done by making use of the fact that the error estimates for Q(h) and Q(2h) equal",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14937,
   0.51879,
   0.80021,
   0.53418
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "M-Q(h)=c_ph^p+\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^{p+1}\\right)\\text{,}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.37935,
   0.54473,
   0.60702,
   0.56143
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "(3.15a)",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.81343,
   0.54737,
   0.86246,
   0.55967
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Caption; caption belum ditautkan ke tabel/gambar"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "M-Q(2h)=c_p(2h)^p+\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^{p+1}\\right)\\text{.}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.37935,
   0.5651,
   0.63384,
   0.5818
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "(3.15b)",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.81281,
   0.56793,
   0.86246,
   0.58023
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Caption; caption belum ditautkan ke tabel/gambar"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "Multiplying equation (3.15a) by 2p and subtracting equation (3.15b) from this yields",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.59229,
   0.77095,
   0.60768
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "2^p(M-Q(h))-(M-Q(2h))=2^p\\left(c_ph^p\\right)-c_p(2h)^p+\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^{p+1}\\right)\\text{,}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.2685,
   0.61925,
   0.74415,
   0.63595
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "such that",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.64605,
   0.22086,
   0.65859
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "\\left(2^p-1\\right)M-2^pQ(h)+Q(2h)=\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^{p+1}\\right)\\text{.}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.3529,
   0.65859,
   0.66101,
   0.67529
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "This means that",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.68203,
   0.27009,
   0.69457
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "M=\\frac{2^pQ(h)-Q(2h)}{2^p-1}+\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^{p+1}\\right)\\text{.}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.38014,
   0.69266,
   0.63265,
   0.72104
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "(3.16)",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.82138,
   0.70167,
   0.86246,
   0.71397
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Caption; caption belum ditautkan ke tabel/gambar"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "The value (2pQ(h) - Q(2h))/(2p - 1) is a new approximation formula for M with an accuracy\nthatis one order higher than the order of Q(h).",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.72775,
   0.8649,
   0.75639
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "Example 3.7.2 (Forward difference of higher accuracy)",
  "text_level": 1,
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.15043,
   0.77254,
   0.56172,
   0.7876
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Heading1; DP-Bench hanya punya 1 level heading; level asli belum diverifikasi"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "As an example, the forward-difference method is considered. The error in the forward-difference\nformula may be written as",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.79705,
   0.8649,
   0.82568
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "f^{\\prime}(x)-Q_f(h)=c_1h+\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^2\\right)\\text{,}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.39555,
   0.82458,
   0.61802,
   0.84127
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "(3.17)",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.82138,
   0.82698,
   0.86246,
   0.83928
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Caption; caption belum ditautkan ke tabel/gambar"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "and the difference for 2h equals",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.14982,
   0.8475,
   0.38366,
   0.86253
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Paragraph"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "f^{\\prime}(x)-Q_f(2h)=c_12h+\\mathcal{O}\\left(h^2\\right)\\text{.}",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.38655,
   0.87298,
   0.62506,
   0.88968
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Equation; isi berupa LaTeX"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "text": "(3.18)",
  "page_idx": 0,
  "bbox": [
   0.82138,
   0.87642,
   0.86246,
   0.88872
  ],
  "in_figure": false,
  "gt_note": "verif:dpbench:upstage; src=Caption; caption belum ditautkan ke tabel/gambar"
 }
]
